# Explainability

Example

The Romanian Deadlift is selected because improving posterior chain strength increases force production, acceleration, deceleration and resilience during explosive combat movements.

Its high eccentric demand also contributes to injury prevention in athletes exposed to repeated sprinting, kicking and wrestling actions.

